{"title":"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/6/e36ef566319486bfd69d5d0f4ea49c8bf8f01058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{N}\\rightarrow\\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> satisfy the following condition: for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd479012b79b5a10a93e25990a18efbe28ba6343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;2026$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/81232ecd8d9e4b5c0f24a00dabec238068f26de9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> equals the maximum number of times a number appears among <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f944272089a25967bcbf73328f79f92cf199dc93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1), f(2), \\ldots, f(k-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"20\" />. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/b/21b59c37d1c83efdab2f3021d5f4f0f3e844eac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)=f(n+f(n))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" /> for infinitely many <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a64508262bb2272e129bd59c31142b17e78b6ad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\in\\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />, given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1e6cd0e4103015efba12e0fc4291f012b467eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> denotes the set of positive integers.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>This problem needs a solution! Please help by adding one.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO\" title=\"2026 INMO\">2026 INMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indian_National_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Indian National Mathematical Olympiad\"> All INMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 70/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 852/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1302/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.482      1 Template:INMO_box\n100.00%    6.482      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36816:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034915 and revision id 284655. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}